Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:05.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nobody trusts the forecast enough to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:09.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,In September I built Agentic Arbiter, an agent for data-centre cooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:14.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Data centres run chillers even when the air outside is already cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:19.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it decides, hour by hour, when switching them off is actually safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:24.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it made no unsafe calls, where the old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:27.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is four hundred extra free-cooling hours a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it missed its target, because the data was patchy, and says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:38.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of eight hundred and forty-two teams, out of nearly four thousand people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,at FortyGuard's hackathon, sponsored by NVIDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:42.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN-backed Cool Coalition featured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:46.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next I want it running on real sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:48.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I looked at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:52.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar on millions of roofs, but the grid can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:54.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I asked twenty-one families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.69,0:00:59.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Seven of the ten with solar have changed habits or are getting a battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I am building a Solar Home Agent, for homes that cannot sell their spare power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:09.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under Pakistan's tariff, go over two hundred units once,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:12.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you lose the cheap rate for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:15.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,That keeps this home under the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:19.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Five thousand rupees this month, and nineteen thousand over the next six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:24.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirteen of them said they would only trust an app that explains itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:29.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,So when it is not sure, it says no, and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:34.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,It still wastes most of its midday sun. Storage is what closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:38.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a simulation, on one real month of Islamabad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:44.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, five to ten homes in Islamabad, starting on WhatsApp, before it becomes an app.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:49.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,An Energy and AI circle at COMSATS, and I would join IRENA NewGen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then one neighbourhood forecast, built with IESCO.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:54.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already on Pakistan's roofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:58.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want the grid to see it, and trust it.
